	"description": [
		"This seminar integrates the liberal arts with the experience of healthcare work and the search for a vocation or career. Course content will include both an off-campus internship and on-campus class sessions that connect academic theories/analyses of work with their particular internship experience. Students will also consider and articulate the value of the liberal arts for their pursuit of a creative, productive, and satisfying professional life in the healthcare world. Offered during January Term. Prerequisite: Junior or senior standing."
